msgid ""
"By the way, lemme know if you wanna replay the main story with your current "
"stats. I can make that happen for you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Taking advantage of this option will allow you to create clear data "
"carrying over your play data from Premium Adventure."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid ""
"Caution! This differs from an ordinary gamesave.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"<Color:255,255,0,255>Starting New Game+ with the data created here will "
"only<Color:Default>\r\n"
"<Color:255,255,0,255>allow you to transfer your abilities, items, and "
"money.<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid ""
"Additionally, selecting \"Yes\" will end Premium\r\n"
"Adventure and <Color:255,255,0,255>return you to the title "
"screen<Color:Default>.\r\n"
"\r\n"
"Starting Premium Adventure with clear data will\r\n"
"allow you to transfer all elements from your story,\r\n"
"including inventory, substories finished, and more."
msgstr ""

